@startuml

actor Customer
participant "Web App" as App
participant "Reservation API" as API
database Database as DB
participant "Payment Service" as Payment

Customer -> App: Search rooms
App -> API: Check availability
API -> DB: Check room availability
DB --> API: Available rooms
API --> App: Available rooms
App --> Customer: Display available rooms

Customer -> App: Make reservation
App -> API: Create reservation
API -> DB: Save reservation

API -> Payment: Process payment
Payment --> API: Payment result

API --> App: Booking confirmation
App --> Customer: Display confirmation

@enduml